{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "kind": "feature-gate",
  "description": "Feature switches and the feature gate (REQ-API-10, VK-A2; FT01B-01..03). Features (user 2026-11-08): MULTI_VIEW, EDIT, MASK_TRACKING, AVATAR, EXPORT; MASK_TRACKING and AVATAR depend on EDIT, EXPORT and MULTI_VIEW are independent; playback and image viewing are never hidden or gated. Kotlin (videokit-testkit FeatureGateVectors) and Dart run the same cases. 'features' is VideoKitConfig.features (VideoKitFeature wire name -> FeatureMode wire name; unknown features are ignored and unknown modes read as ENABLED). 'gate' is the host's checkFeature: absent = the host does not implement it (everything allowed); otherwise feature -> answer, '*' for every other feature, answers 'ALLOWED', 'ALLOWED:<badge>', 'DENIED' (Denied without marker), 'DENIED:<badge>' or 'THROW' (the callback fails: counts as DENIED without marker); a feature missing from a present gate without '*' is ALLOWED. A hidden feature is never asked: every query and call answers FEATURE_DISABLED. 'requires': contract features the case needs (EDITING); subjects without them skip the case. Steps run in order on one instance; edit steps use one project that 'createEditProject' creates. Expectations: 'OK', 'APPLIED', 'EXECUTED', 'SUCCEEDED'; a thrown or returned stable error by code ('FEATURE_DISABLED', 'FEATURE_DENIED', optionally ':<badge>' for the badge param); 'UNSUPPORTED:<UnsupportedReason>' for command results; 'FAILED:<code>' for an export; 'PROBLEM:<code>' for a precheck that is not ok; 'ERROR:<code>' for candidate detection.",
  "steps": {
    "featureMode": "kit.featureMode(feature) == expect (FeatureMode wire name)",
    "checkFeature": "kit.checkFeature(feature) with no session: expect 'ALLOWED[:badge]', 'DENIED[:badge]' or 'FEATURE_DISABLED' (thrown or returned, never asking the host)",
    "hiddenFeatures": "capabilities().hiddenFeatures == expect (set of wire names, any order); each has its capability keys in unavailableReasons as FEATURE_DISABLED",
    "createEditProject": "kit.createEditProject(): 'OK' or a thrown code",
    "addSource": "project.addSource(a playable video): 'OK' or a thrown code",
    "edit": "project.apply(command): ADD_CLIP (whole first source, at most 3 s), SPLIT (first clip at its middle), ADD_MASK (MANUAL, MOSAIC, first second), SET_STYLE_BLUR / SET_STYLE_IMAGE / SET_MASK_AVATAR (last mask, or 'none' when there is none), START_TRACKING (last mask or 'none', FACE). Clip commands use EDIT; mask, style and tracking commands EDIT + MASK_TRACKING; SET_STYLE_IMAGE and SET_MASK_AVATAR EDIT + AVATAR",
    "detectCandidates": "project.detectCandidates(0): 'OK' (no error) or 'ERROR:<code>' (EDIT + MASK_TRACKING)",
    "checkExport": "project.checkExport(default request, a working sink): 'OK' or 'PROBLEM:<code>' (EXPORT)",
    "export": "project.export(default request, a working sink): 'SUCCEEDED' or 'FAILED:<code>' (EXPORT); a failed export never opens the sink",
    "singleBind": "a SINGLE session binds a playable video: 'EXECUTED' or 'UNSUPPORTED:<reason>'",
    "multiSlotBind": "a MULTI_SLOT session is created and binds a playable video: 'EXECUTED', 'UNSUPPORTED:<reason>' or a thrown code from createSession",
    "gateCalls": "number of checkFeature calls so far for 'feature' (any session id) == expect"
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "no_gate_allows_everything",
      "description": "FT01B-03: a host without checkFeature behaves as before REQ-API-10",
      "requires": ["EDITING"],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "checkFeature", "feature": "EDIT", "expect": "ALLOWED" },
        { "op": "checkFeature", "feature": "MASK_TRACKING", "expect": "ALLOWED" },
        { "op": "checkFeature", "feature": "MULTI_VIEW", "expect": "ALLOWED" },
        { "op": "featureMode", "feature": "AVATAR", "expect": "ENABLED" },
        { "op": "hiddenFeatures", "expect": [] },
        { "op": "createEditProject", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "addSource", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_CLIP", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_MASK", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "SET_STYLE_BLUR", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "checkExport", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "export", "expect": "SUCCEEDED" },
        { "op": "multiSlotBind", "expect": "EXECUTED" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "playback_only_host",
      "description": "Playback and multi-view without editing: no gate is asked for playback",
      "requires": [],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "singleBind", "expect": "EXECUTED" },
        { "op": "multiSlotBind", "expect": "EXECUTED" },
        { "op": "gateCalls", "feature": "EDIT", "expect": 0 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hidden_edit_hides_dependants",
      "description": "FT01B-01: hiding EDIT hides MASK_TRACKING and AVATAR; EXPORT and MULTI_VIEW keep their own switches",
      "features": { "EDIT": "HIDDEN" },
      "requires": [],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "featureMode", "feature": "EDIT", "expect": "HIDDEN" },
        { "op": "featureMode", "feature": "MASK_TRACKING", "expect": "HIDDEN" },
        { "op": "featureMode", "feature": "AVATAR", "expect": "HIDDEN" },
        { "op": "featureMode", "feature": "EXPORT", "expect": "ENABLED" },
        { "op": "featureMode", "feature": "MULTI_VIEW", "expect": "ENABLED" },
        { "op": "hiddenFeatures", "expect": ["EDIT", "MASK_TRACKING", "AVATAR"] },
        { "op": "checkFeature", "feature": "EDIT", "expect": "FEATURE_DISABLED" },
        { "op": "checkFeature", "feature": "MASK_TRACKING", "expect": "FEATURE_DISABLED" },
        { "op": "createEditProject", "expect": "FEATURE_DISABLED" },
        { "op": "multiSlotBind", "expect": "EXECUTED" },
        { "op": "gateCalls", "feature": "EDIT", "expect": 0 },
        { "op": "gateCalls", "feature": "MASK_TRACKING", "expect": 0 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hidden_mask_tracking",
      "description": "Hiding MASK_TRACKING rejects masks, tracking and candidate detection; clips and export still work",
      "features": { "MASK_TRACKING": "HIDDEN" },
      "requires": ["EDITING"],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "hiddenFeatures", "expect": ["MASK_TRACKING"] },
        { "op": "createEditProject", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "addSource", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_CLIP", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_MASK", "expect": "UNSUPPORTED:FEATURE_DISABLED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "START_TRACKING", "expect": "UNSUPPORTED:FEATURE_DISABLED" },
        { "op": "detectCandidates", "expect": "ERROR:FEATURE_DISABLED" },
        { "op": "export", "expect": "SUCCEEDED" },
        { "op": "gateCalls", "feature": "MASK_TRACKING", "expect": 0 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hidden_avatar_only",
      "description": "Hiding AVATAR rejects the image style and avatars; other mask styles work",
      "features": { "AVATAR": "HIDDEN" },
      "requires": ["EDITING"],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "hiddenFeatures", "expect": ["AVATAR"] },
        { "op": "createEditProject", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "addSource", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_CLIP", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_MASK", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "SET_STYLE_BLUR", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "SET_STYLE_IMAGE", "expect": "UNSUPPORTED:FEATURE_DISABLED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "SET_MASK_AVATAR", "expect": "UNSUPPORTED:FEATURE_DISABLED" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "avatar_enabled_reaches_the_command",
      "description": "With AVATAR enabled the gate passes and the command gets the implementation's own answer (NOT_IMPLEMENTED until VK-M5A)",
      "requires": ["EDITING"],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "createEditProject", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "addSource", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_CLIP", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_MASK", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "SET_MASK_AVATAR", "expect": "UNSUPPORTED:NOT_IMPLEMENTED" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hidden_export_keeps_editing",
      "description": "A hidden export fails the precheck and the export without opening the sink; editing stays enabled",
      "features": { "EXPORT": "HIDDEN" },
      "requires": ["EDITING"],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "hiddenFeatures", "expect": ["EXPORT"] },
        { "op": "featureMode", "feature": "EDIT", "expect": "ENABLED" },
        { "op": "createEditProject", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "addSource", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_CLIP", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_MASK", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "checkExport", "expect": "PROBLEM:FEATURE_DISABLED" },
        { "op": "export", "expect": "FAILED:FEATURE_DISABLED" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hidden_multi_view",
      "description": "A hidden multi-view rejects multi-slot sessions; single playback is unaffected",
      "features": { "MULTI_VIEW": "HIDDEN" },
      "requires": [],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "hiddenFeatures", "expect": ["MULTI_VIEW"] },
        { "op": "checkFeature", "feature": "MULTI_VIEW", "expect": "FEATURE_DISABLED" },
        { "op": "multiSlotBind", "expect": "FEATURE_DISABLED" },
        { "op": "singleBind", "expect": "EXECUTED" },
        { "op": "gateCalls", "feature": "MULTI_VIEW", "expect": 0 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hidden_wins_over_gate",
      "description": "A hidden feature is rejected even when the host would allow it; the host is not asked",
      "features": { "EXPORT": "HIDDEN" },
      "gate": { "*": "ALLOWED" },
      "requires": ["EDITING"],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "createEditProject", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "addSource", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_CLIP", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "export", "expect": "FAILED:FEATURE_DISABLED" },
        { "op": "gateCalls", "feature": "EXPORT", "expect": 0 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hidden_feature_query_is_disabled",
      "description": "Querying a hidden feature answers FEATURE_DISABLED without asking the gate (both platforms)",
      "features": { "AVATAR": "HIDDEN" },
      "gate": { "*": "ALLOWED" },
      "requires": [],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "checkFeature", "feature": "AVATAR", "expect": "FEATURE_DISABLED" },
        { "op": "checkFeature", "feature": "EDIT", "expect": "ALLOWED" },
        { "op": "gateCalls", "feature": "AVATAR", "expect": 0 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "unknown_switches_are_ignored",
      "description": "Unknown feature names (including the pre-confirmation MASK) are ignored and an unknown mode reads as ENABLED",
      "features": { "FUTURE_FEATURE": "HIDDEN", "MASK": "HIDDEN", "MULTI_VIEW": "SOMETIMES" },
      "requires": [],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "hiddenFeatures", "expect": [] },
        { "op": "featureMode", "feature": "MULTI_VIEW", "expect": "ENABLED" },
        { "op": "featureMode", "feature": "MASK_TRACKING", "expect": "ENABLED" },
        { "op": "multiSlotBind", "expect": "EXECUTED" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "denied_edit",
      "description": "FT01B-02: a denied edit rejects adding sources, with the host's badge; playback is unaffected",
      "gate": { "EDIT": "DENIED:LOCK" },
      "requires": ["EDITING"],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "checkFeature", "feature": "EDIT", "expect": "DENIED:LOCK" },
        { "op": "createEditProject", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "addSource", "expect": "FEATURE_DENIED:LOCK" },
        { "op": "singleBind", "expect": "EXECUTED" },
        { "op": "multiSlotBind", "expect": "EXECUTED" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "denied_mask_tracking_keeps_clips",
      "description": "Denied masks and tracking return Unsupported; clip commands still apply; denied answers are asked again",
      "gate": { "MASK_TRACKING": "DENIED" },
      "requires": ["EDITING"],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "createEditProject", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "addSource", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_CLIP", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_MASK", "expect": "UNSUPPORTED:FEATURE_DENIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "SPLIT", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_MASK", "expect": "UNSUPPORTED:FEATURE_DENIED" },
        { "op": "gateCalls", "feature": "MASK_TRACKING", "expect": 2 },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "START_TRACKING", "expect": "UNSUPPORTED:FEATURE_DENIED" },
        { "op": "detectCandidates", "expect": "ERROR:FEATURE_DENIED" },
        { "op": "export", "expect": "SUCCEEDED" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "denied_avatar_keeps_masks",
      "description": "A denied avatar rejects the image style and avatars; masks still apply",
      "gate": { "AVATAR": "DENIED:LOCK" },
      "requires": ["EDITING"],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "createEditProject", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "addSource", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_CLIP", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_MASK", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "SET_STYLE_IMAGE", "expect": "UNSUPPORTED:FEATURE_DENIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "SET_MASK_AVATAR", "expect": "UNSUPPORTED:FEATURE_DENIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "SET_STYLE_BLUR", "expect": "APPLIED" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "export_locked_editing_open",
      "description": "User 2026-11-08: a host may lock export and leave editing open",
      "gate": { "EXPORT": "DENIED:LOCK" },
      "requires": ["EDITING"],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "checkFeature", "feature": "EDIT", "expect": "ALLOWED" },
        { "op": "createEditProject", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "addSource", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_CLIP", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_MASK", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "checkExport", "expect": "PROBLEM:FEATURE_DENIED" },
        { "op": "export", "expect": "FAILED:FEATURE_DENIED" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "denied_multi_view",
      "description": "A denied multi-view slot is not bound; single playback is unaffected",
      "gate": { "MULTI_VIEW": "DENIED:LOCK" },
      "requires": [],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "checkFeature", "feature": "MULTI_VIEW", "expect": "DENIED:LOCK" },
        { "op": "multiSlotBind", "expect": "UNSUPPORTED:FEATURE_DENIED" },
        { "op": "singleBind", "expect": "EXECUTED" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "allowed_with_trial_badge",
      "description": "An allowed answer may carry a marker for the entry",
      "gate": { "EDIT": "ALLOWED:TRIAL" },
      "requires": ["EDITING"],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "checkFeature", "feature": "EDIT", "expect": "ALLOWED:TRIAL" },
        { "op": "createEditProject", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "addSource", "expect": "OK" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gate_failure_denies",
      "description": "A gate callback that fails counts as denied without a marker",
      "gate": { "MULTI_VIEW": "THROW" },
      "requires": [],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "checkFeature", "feature": "MULTI_VIEW", "expect": "DENIED" },
        { "op": "multiSlotBind", "expect": "UNSUPPORTED:FEATURE_DENIED" },
        { "op": "singleBind", "expect": "EXECUTED" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "allowed_is_remembered_per_project",
      "description": "Within one project an allowed answer is asked once; a feature entered is not taken away mid-work",
      "gate": { "*": "ALLOWED" },
      "requires": ["EDITING"],
      "steps": [
        { "op": "createEditProject", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "addSource", "expect": "OK" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_CLIP", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "SPLIT", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_MASK", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "edit", "command": "ADD_MASK", "expect": "APPLIED" },
        { "op": "gateCalls", "feature": "EDIT", "expect": 1 },
        { "op": "gateCalls", "feature": "MASK_TRACKING", "expect": 1 }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
